flex: 6/10
shape: Directional Twin
camber type: C2x Directional (shortened rocker between feet with lengthened directional camber to tip and tail, more loaded pressure in tip and tail than regular C2)
width options: Wide, Ultra Wide
target rider: Bigger riders with big boots (smallest waist width 26.8cm)
mounting system: 2x4 Inserts
topsheet: Eco Sublimated Poly Topsheet (eco-friendly sublimation)
