core: HP - Horsepower Construction Core (60% Aspen, 40% Paulownia with Triax and Biax Fibreglass, lighter, smoother, damp ride)
sidewall: Birch Internal, UHMW Sintered Sidewall (ultra-high molecular weight polyethylene, exceptional impact resistance and resilience)
base: Sintered Knife Cut Base (fast sintered material, die-cut to reduce waste)
edge technology: Magne-Traction (seven strategically placed serrations along edges for grip in any condition)
tip/tail protection: UHMW Tip/Tail Impact Deflection (edge removed around nose and tail, replaced with UHMW material, easy repair, reduced swing weight)
